.\" -------- fancyquote(1) --------
.TH FANCYQUOTE 1 "2025-08-29" "fancyquote 0.1"
.SH NAME
fancyquote \- display a centered quote in the terminal
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fancyquote
prints a centered quote using the wide-character ncurses API, wrapping long lines and
handling multi-line input until interrupted (with any key press). If no arguments are
supplied, the quote is read from standard input.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Display usage information and exit.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Display version information and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, non-zero on error.
.SH EXAMPLES
fancyquote Hello there General Kenobi
.br
printf 'It\'s over, Anakin.\nI have the high ground.' | fancyquote
.fi
.SH AUTHORS
Written by sys-deamon on GitHub
.SH BUGS
Report at https://github.com/sys-deamon/fancy-quote